{"id":"4e6ce97184760fe2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-indestructibility.md","title":"Relative Laver-Indestructibility Certificate","display":"thm-indestructibility — Relative Laver-Indestructibility Certificate","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-indestructibility","aliases":["58-thm-indestructibility"],"display":"thm-indestructibility — Relative Laver-Indestructibility Certificate","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-indestructibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-indestructibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-indestructibility — Relative Laver-Indestructibility Certificate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,Q,R,\\mathcal C,M\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,Q,R,\\mathcal C,M\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, and the forcing relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaDirectedClosedForcing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaDirectedClosedForcing}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}directed\\text{-}closed\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedClosedForcing}_S(Q,R,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq Q\\;\\Bigl(\n|D|&lt;\\kappa\n\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall p,q\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\\exists s\\in Q\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle s,d\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kappa\\text{-}directed\\text{-}closed\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedClosedForcing}_S(Q,R,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall D\\subseteq Q\\;\\Bigl(\n|D|&lt;\\kappa\n\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall p,q\\in D\\;\\exists r\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\to\\exists s\\in Q\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle s,d\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}indestructibility\\text{-}certificate}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S(\\mathcal C,M,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,R_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\Sigma,\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}},\\check\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\n\\langle P,R_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\Sigma,\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}},\\check\\kappa\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R_P)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in R_P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\check\\kappa,P)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\Vdash_{M,P}\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}(\\check\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laver\\text{-}indestructibility\\text{-}certificate}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S(\\mathcal C,M,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,R_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\Sigma,\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}},\\check\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\n\\langle P,R_P,\\mathbf1_P,\\Sigma,\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}},\\check\\kappa\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R_P)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in R_P)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\check\\kappa,P)\n\\land\\mathbf1_P\\Vdash_{M,P}\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}(\\check\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indestructibility\\text{-}certificate\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S(\\mathcal C,M,\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\pi_2(\\mathcal C)\\Vdash_{M,\\pi_0(\\mathcal C)}\n\\pi_4(\\mathcal C)(\\pi_5(\\mathcal C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indestructibility\\text{-}certificate\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaverIndestructibilityCertificate}_S(\\mathcal C,M,\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\pi_2(\\mathcal C)\\Vdash_{M,\\pi_0(\\mathcal C)}\n\\pi_4(\\mathcal C)(\\pi_5(\\mathcal C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directed closure is fully expanded: every directed set of conditions of size below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> has a common lower bound.</li>\n<li>The certificate keeps the forcing order, top condition, object-language formula, and canonical name explicit. The formula <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}\">\\(\\Phi_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\)</span> must be separately certified to express preservation of supercompactness by every subsequent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-directed-closed forcing.</li>\n<li>The original assertion used undefined Laver-preparation and directed-closure predicates and inserted the meta-level predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\)</span> directly under forcing notation. A faithful existence theorem requires an object-language coding atom for the indestructibility sentence; until that exists, this file does not claim the unsupported existence step.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Laver, Making the supercompactness of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> indestructible under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-directed closed forcing</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,Q,R,\\mathcal C,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PName}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\m